name: ['Aether Membrane', 'Angelic Shield', 'Anger', 'Armillary Sphere', 'Augury Owl', 'Azorius Chancery', 'Bloodfire Colossus', 'Bloodfire Kavu', 'Cache Raiders', 'Chartooth Cougar', 'Clone', 'Coral Fighters', "Cosi's Ravager", 'Cryptic Annelid', 'Downhill Charge', 'Earth Servant', 'Fiery Hellhound', 'Flood Plain', 'Galepowder Mage', 'Geyser Glider', 'Greater Stone Spirit', 'Island', 'Jaws of Stone', "Jedit's Dragoons", "Journeyer's Kite", 'Kor Cartographer', 'Koth of the Hammer', 'Lithophage', 'Minamo Sightbender', 'Mistmeadow Witch', 'Mountain', 'Neurok Invisimancer', 'New Benalia', 'Oblivion Ring', 'Overrule', 'Path to Exile', "Pilgrim's Eye", 'Plains', 'Plated Geopede', 'Preordain', 'Primal Plasma', 'Pygmy Pyrosaur', 'Revoke Existence', 'Safe Passage', 'Sawtooth Loon', 'Scroll Thief', 'Searing Blaze', 'Seismic Strike', 'Sejiri Refuge', 'Sigil of Sleep', 'Sky Spirit', 'Slith Strider', 'Soaring Seacliff', 'Sphinx of Uthuun', 'Spire Barrage', 'Steel of the Godhead', 'Stone Giant', 'Sunblast Angel', 'Torchling', 'Vanish into Memory', 'Venser, the Sojourner', 'Volley of Boulders', 'Vulshok Battlegear', 'Vulshok Berserker', 'Vulshok Morningstar', 'Vulshok Sorcerer', 'Wall of Denial', "Wayfarer's Bauble", 'Whitemane Lion', 'Windreaver']
